---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Img from '../components/Img.astro';
import Spotify from '../components/icons/Spotify.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Denis Maksimov" description="Denis Maksimov, Product Designer at dōTERRA based in Cincinnati, OH, designing mobile apps, websites, platforms and design systems." canonicalPath="/about.html" hasHero glow="page">

  {/* ===== Hero: name, short bio and photo, in the middle of the screen ===== */}
  {/* data-glow-wrap: while the cursor is over this text (and over each section's text below), the
      page's glow clears from behind it and wraps around it as a band of colour (src/scripts/glow.ts) */}
  <section class="about-hero container" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="grid about-hero__grid">
      <div class="about-hero__text" data-glow-wrap>
        <h1 id="about-title" class="about-hero__name hero-in">Denis Maksimov</h1>
        <p class="about-hero__bio hero-in">Product Designer at dōTERRA, based in Cincinnati, OH. I design mobile apps, websites, platforms and design systems, and I’m looking for design roles after graduating in May ’27.</p>
      </div>
      {/* A thin-lined rectangle frames the photo; on hover both grow together */}
      <div class="about-hero__media hero-in">
        <figure class="about-hero__photo">
          <Img src="denis-portrait.jpg" alt="Portrait of Denis Maksimov" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 56vw, max(11.25rem, min(18.6vw, 19.5rem))" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ===== Who I am / What I do / What I believe in, separated by short lines ===== */}
  <div class="about-sections container">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="about-sections__col">
        <hr class="about-divider blur-in">
        <section class="about-section" data-glow-wrap aria-labelledby="who-i-am">
          <h2 id="who-i-am" class="blur-in">Who I am</h2>
          <p class="blur-in">Born and raised in Moscow, Russia, I moved to the United States at the age of 17 to pursue my dreams. Almost 5 years have flown by since then, and now I’m a senior at the University of Cincinnati majoring in IT/Software Development, graduating (hopefully) in May 2027. My adventure in technology and design began a while before that, when I was 15 and got my hands on Figma for the first time. I fell in love with the concept of digital design and started learning the basics of UI/UX, typography, colors, and other topics in this area, which then led me to land my first freelance project at 16. I also realized shortly after that I have a technical side apart from my creative side, which influenced my decision to major in information technology. Some of personal hobbies include tennis, chess, reading, and travel.</p>
        </section>

        <hr class="about-divider blur-in">
        <section class="about-section" data-glow-wrap aria-labelledby="what-i-do">
          <h2 id="what-i-do" class="blur-in">What I do</h2>
          <p class="blur-in">Product design is what clicks for me the most. I design websites, apps, and platforms, but I also go beyond that. I like owning the whole process, from ideation to the final prototypes, and making sure what users need and what the business needs end up in the same product.</p>
        </section>

        <hr class="about-divider blur-in">
        <section class="about-section" data-glow-wrap aria-labelledby="what-i-believe-in">
          <h2 id="what-i-believe-in" class="blur-in">What I believe in</h2>
          <p class="blur-in">I have strong principles in everything I design. I believe that the design of a product should come from the target users’ preferences. I believe that design should be eye-catching and polished yet simple and seamless. I believe that having a system is as important as other parts of design to make sure that there are no inconsistencies. I also believe that great design must tell a story and deliver positive emotions.</p>
          <p class="about-playlist blur-in"><a class="playlist-link" href="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/78eraksErZ72KlZe62RBy9?si=JUrINZ19Qeq29-6UCzZkAg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Spotify /> Check out my playlist</a></p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
